          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best cordless vacuum is the one that fits your floors, your pets and your habits. Choose the Dyson V15 Detect if you want the most complete machine, the Shark Vertex for pet hair on a budget, the Samsung Bespoke Jet if emptying the bin is what you hate, and the Eufy or Bissell where cost matters most.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whatever you buy, check that the battery is replaceable, read the runtime for the mode you will actually use, and keep the filter clean. Those three habits matter more to long-term satisfaction than any suction rating on the box.
          </p>
